(5480047, 789675, 66515, '<td valign="top">While the stool is a major element in the scene, I wouldn''t say it is the subject. That of course isn''t a requirement of the challenge but something I would just point out as an observation. <br/> <br/>Nice soft feel to this image that really creates a mood. The pose is terrific and helps add an air of mystery to the picture. The makeup and hair really add to this as well. <br/> <br/>All of the chosen elements (the stool, the lantern, the location) really create a great story.</td>', 'While the stool is a major element in the scene, I wouldn''t say it is the subject. That of course isn''t a requirement of the challenge but something I would just point out as an observation.  Nice soft feel to this image that really creates a mood. The pose is terrific and helps add an air of mystery to the picture. The makeup and hair really add to this as well.  All of the chosen elements (the stool, the lantern, the location) really create a great story.', '2009-05-11 02:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480048, 789852, 67361, '<td valign="top">Nice image</td>', 'Nice image', '2009-05-11 02:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480049, 790101, 63812, '<td valign="top">very nice composition...I love the "old" in this</td>', 'very nice composition...I love the "old" in this', '2009-05-11 02:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480051, 789981, 67361, '<td valign="top">wow! very nice</td>', 'wow! very nice', '2009-05-11 02:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480053, 789218, 66515, '<td valign="top">In a way, there''s almost two shots here. The rows of chairs on the right and the desk and chair on the left. In a way this scene really feels divided and I find myself bouncing back and forth between the two parts of the image.</td>', 'In a way, there''s almost two shots here. The rows of chairs on the right and the desk and chair on the left. In a way this scene really feels divided and I find myself bouncing back and forth between the two parts of the image.', '2009-05-11 02:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480054, 789974, 67361, '<td valign="top">Nice image</td>', 'Nice image', '2009-05-11 02:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
