(5480057, 790027, 66515, '<td valign="top">The added vignette is really heavy handed in my opinion and detracts from the image. It almost looks like you shot the picture through a tunnel.</td>', 'The added vignette is really heavy handed in my opinion and detracts from the image. It almost looks like you shot the picture through a tunnel.', '2009-05-11 02:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480061, 790072, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle abstract that looks great in monochrome. Sepia might be another option but personally I like this the way it is. Great contrast and subtle control of depth of field.</td>', 'Nice subtle abstract that looks great in monochrome. Sepia might be another option but personally I like this the way it is. Great contrast and subtle control of depth of field.', '2009-05-11 02:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480066, 790124, 66515, '<td valign="top">With the depth of field you''ve selected, you''ve shifted emphasis mainly to the kitten. If you went with a smaller aperture to increase depth of field you would bring the drawers into focus more and they would be more prominent in the scene and create a stronger relationship between the drawers and the kitten to tell your story better. The position of the kitten would allow it to remain as the primary subject however. <br/> <br/>That aside, the kitten is quite cute and you''ve captured a terrific look of curiosity. The eyes are in great focus. You''ve handled the exposure quite well and left the white hair white without losing detail.</td>', 'With the depth of field you''ve selected, you''ve shifted emphasis mainly to the kitten. If you went with a smaller aperture to increase depth of field you would bring the drawers into focus more and they would be more prominent in the scene and create a stronger relationship between the drawers and the kitten to tell your story better. The position of the kitten would allow it to remain as the primary subject however.  That aside, the kitten is quite cute and you''ve captured a terrific look of curiosity. The eyes are in great focus. You''ve handled the exposure quite well and left the white hair white without losing detail.', '2009-05-11 02:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480069, 788802, 34938, '<td valign="top">I like the HDR in this...I don''t usually like the plasticky look in some HDR shots, but this works well to a great effect 8</td>', 'I like the HDR in this...I don''t usually like the plasticky look in some HDR shots, but this works well to a great effect 8', '2009-05-11 02:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480071, 788999, 34938, '<td valign="top">A ribbon winner in my view...beautiful, stunning, great b and w conversion...10 from me (and isn''t 720 pixels awesome!)</td>', 'A ribbon winner in my view...beautiful, stunning, great b and w conversion...10 from me (and isn''t 720 pixels awesome!)', '2009-05-11 02:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
