(5480206, 790063, 60915, '<td valign="top">a lot of people will probably say there''s too much space! But I''m really enjoying it! In a world where everything seems to get crammed into smaller and smaller spaces, it nice to find a little place like this with plenty of room and breathing space! : )</td>', 'a lot of people will probably say there''s too much space! But I''m really enjoying it! In a world where everything seems to get crammed into smaller and smaller spaces, it nice to find a little place like this with plenty of room and breathing space! : )', '2009-05-11 05:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480208, 789810, 60915, '<td valign="top">oh no, not again!! : ) For some reason the tilted lamp makes this for me. I think it''s kinda symbolizing the angry housewife standing over the henpecked husband! : )</td>', 'oh no, not again!! : ) For some reason the tilted lamp makes this for me. I think it''s kinda symbolizing the angry housewife standing over the henpecked husband! : )', '2009-05-11 05:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480211, 789933, 60915, '<td valign="top">Got some wild psychedelic colours happenin there!: )<br/>Probably won''t appeal to your average voter, but a great piece of abstract art! : )</td>', 'Got some wild psychedelic colours happenin there!: )Probably won''t appeal to your average voter, but a great piece of abstract art! : )', '2009-05-11 05:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480213, 790130, 60915, '<td valign="top">okay, ventriloquist dummies freak me out more than dolls! <br/>But I love the creepiness, those hypnotic eyes, the stiff unnatural limbs and the unrealistic mouth! It''s a lovely chair but I reckon the little guy steals the show! Still my favorite shot though! : )</td>', 'okay, ventriloquist dummies freak me out more than dolls! But I love the creepiness, those hypnotic eyes, the stiff unnatural limbs and the unrealistic mouth! It''s a lovely chair but I reckon the little guy steals the show! Still my favorite shot though! : )', '2009-05-11 05:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480215, 789852, 60915, '<td valign="top">out of the box...and into the drawer! : )</td>', 'out of the box...and into the drawer! : )', '2009-05-11 05:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
