(5480222, 788999, 60915, '<td valign="top">Perfect!! well all except that bit of fluff sticking out of the arm (of the chair). But I like that bit of fluff sticking out. I''m so glad you didn''t clone it out, cause it will annoy people, and I like when that happens! : )</td>', 'Perfect!! well all except that bit of fluff sticking out of the arm (of the chair). But I like that bit of fluff sticking out. I''m so glad you didn''t clone it out, cause it will annoy people, and I like when that happens! : )', '2009-05-11 05:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480241, 788792, 100393, '<td valign="top">Well, I have mixed feeling about this - it is an amazing shot with a chair in it. Does the chair work with the rest of the image, is it a complementary element in the overall composition? In absolute terms - no; in the context of this challenge - it is clearly an essential element but still a little incidental.<br/> <br/>I am conflicted in how to score...</td>', 'Well, I have mixed feeling about this - it is an amazing shot with a chair in it. Does the chair work with the rest of the image, is it a complementary element in the overall composition? In absolute terms - no; in the context of this challenge - it is clearly an essential element but still a little incidental. I am conflicted in how to score...', '2009-05-11 05:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5480281, 790105, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this except the cut off at the bottom...</td>', 'I like everything about this except the cut off at the bottom...', '2009-05-11 07:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
