(5480513, 788999, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is stunning and so artful. I love her dress and the upturned foot. The chair seems slightly unlevel - if you tilted it left would she look off?  No big deal.  It''s a great shot. 8</td>', 'This is stunning and so artful. I love her dress and the upturned foot. The chair seems slightly unlevel - if you tilted it left would she look off?  No big deal.  It''s a great shot. 8', '2009-05-11 11:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
