(5481978, 788808, 16106, '<td valign="top">It looks like the front edge of the bench is slightly out of your focal field. Had it been as sharp as the center of the bench and the grass under it, it would have popped more clearly from the backround.</td>', 'It looks like the front edge of the bench is slightly out of your focal field. Had it been as sharp as the center of the bench and the grass under it, it would have popped more clearly from the backround.', '2009-05-12 12:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5481986, 789656, 16106, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but am not sure why you chose such a narrow depth of field. So much of the image is out of focus and there is nothing special about the parts that have been picked out in the focal plane. I think the lines are really good here, with great eye movement all through the image, and a nice job on the reduction.</td>', 'I like the composition, but am not sure why you chose such a narrow depth of field. So much of the image is out of focus and there is nothing special about the parts that have been picked out in the focal plane. I think the lines are really good here, with great eye movement all through the image, and a nice job on the reduction.', '2009-05-12 12:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5481989, 790026, 16106, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet this image breaks down into two voting blocks, those that have been following the topaz or HDR threads will like it, and those that haven''t will see it as a snapshot.<br/> Including the area to the left of the barber''s pole and squeezing the door to the right makes an unbalanced and uncomfortable image, which may be the effect you wanted (I for one like it) but its not the sort of framing that usually is popular here.</td>', 'I''ll bet this image breaks down into two voting blocks, those that have been following the topaz or HDR threads will like it, and those that haven''t will see it as a snapshot. Including the area to the left of the barber''s pole and squeezing the door to the right makes an unbalanced and uncomfortable image, which may be the effect you wanted (I for one like it) but its not the sort of framing that usually is popular here.', '2009-05-12 12:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5481993, 790101, 16106, '<td valign="top">About as simple as it gets. nice choice of colors and textures to compliment and contrast, interesting framing and great lighting to bring it all out. My top pick at this point.</td>', 'About as simple as it gets. nice choice of colors and textures to compliment and contrast, interesting framing and great lighting to bring it all out. My top pick at this point.', '2009-05-12 12:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5481999, 789214, 16106, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you flipped this, It seems like a nice bold composition that has a gimmick tossed in at the end to attract attention, but it didn''t need it.</td>', 'Not sure why you flipped this, It seems like a nice bold composition that has a gimmick tossed in at the end to attract attention, but it didn''t need it.', '2009-05-12 12:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482008, 789933, 16106, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors and composition, but I''m not sure what I''m looking at. To say that the piece of furniture in the frame is hard to find is an understatement, I think I see a chair in there, but it is not the first thing that jumps out at me. Good marks on creating an interesting image, not so much on meeting the challenge head on.</td>', 'Interesting colors and composition, but I''m not sure what I''m looking at. To say that the piece of furniture in the frame is hard to find is an understatement, I think I see a chair in there, but it is not the first thing that jumps out at me. Good marks on creating an interesting image, not so much on meeting the challenge head on.', '2009-05-12 12:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482014, 789936, 16106, '<td valign="top">More bed, and less curtain and wall space would have made a richer image. I like the tangled lead lines, but i want more of those rich tones, reflections and shadows off the bed itself.</td>', 'More bed, and less curtain and wall space would have made a richer image. I like the tangled lead lines, but i want more of those rich tones, reflections and shadows off the bed itself.', '2009-05-12 12:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482018, 789675, 103564, '<td valign="top">great photo<br/>I really like it</td>', 'great photoI really like it', '2009-05-12 12:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482019, 789424, 16106, '<td valign="top">Quirky framing and angle which supports the style of the table, but the tones seem muted. I wish you had some true blacks to make the table pop free of the backround.</td>', 'Quirky framing and angle which supports the style of the table, but the tones seem muted. I wish you had some true blacks to make the table pop free of the backround.', '2009-05-12 12:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482024, 790127, 16106, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and execution, ought to ribbon. my only gripe is the rather heavy handed dodging on the back of the boy''s head. I like the fact that you burned the chair forward to make it the primary feature, but you went a bit too far in that one spot. On the whole, very well done.</td>', 'Very nice idea and execution, ought to ribbon. my only gripe is the rather heavy handed dodging on the back of the boy''s head. I like the fact that you burned the chair forward to make it the primary feature, but you went a bit too far in that one spot. On the whole, very well done.', '2009-05-12 12:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482037, 789954, 16106, '<td valign="top">Another Topaz thread veteran? I love the painterly touch here. Nice tones, mood and shadings. I particularly like the leading like of the chair arm coming out of the corner to escort the eye into the frame. This would make a lovely print. That said, DPC seems to like it''s manipulation more hidden than this, but lets hope you don''t get hammered for what is a good job here.</td>', 'Another Topaz thread veteran? I love the painterly touch here. Nice tones, mood and shadings. I particularly like the leading like of the chair arm coming out of the corner to escort the eye into the frame. This would make a lovely print. That said, DPC seems to like it''s manipulation more hidden than this, but lets hope you don''t get hammered for what is a good job here.', '2009-05-12 13:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482043, 789505, 16106, '<td valign="top">This looks like an interesting lamp, but the amount of flash used robs it of the quality of the light it might emit. I''ll bet those little pieces of cut glass bend and play with the light moving through them, but I can''t see it here. Closer in with more lamp and less living room and less flash, and this could have been so much more.</td>', 'This looks like an interesting lamp, but the amount of flash used robs it of the quality of the light it might emit. I''ll bet those little pieces of cut glass bend and play with the light moving through them, but I can''t see it here. Closer in with more lamp and less living room and less flash, and this could have been so much more.', '2009-05-12 13:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482055, 789675, 16106, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot Judi, I like the way the greens play off the violets, the softness of the image while keeping lots of detail; but you must have known that the stool is too small a part of the image to score much more than 5.7, in free study it would have done much better. A far better image than a challenge entry.</td>', 'Lovely shot Judi, I like the way the greens play off the violets, the softness of the image while keeping lots of detail; but you must have known that the stool is too small a part of the image to score much more than 5.7, in free study it would have done much better. A far better image than a challenge entry.', '2009-05-12 13:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482063, 788882, 16106, '<td valign="top">I relay like the mood here but it just seems so soft. The grimy industrial vibe is better served by picking up on lots of mid tone contrast, here it is as soft as a pillow.</td>', 'I relay like the mood here but it just seems so soft. The grimy industrial vibe is better served by picking up on lots of mid tone contrast, here it is as soft as a pillow.', '2009-05-12 13:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482065, 789906, 16106, '<td valign="top">I like the similar patterns you pick up in the cushions, shoe fabric and rug, but the furniture here is more implied than present.</td>', 'I like the similar patterns you pick up in the cushions, shoe fabric and rug, but the furniture here is more implied than present.', '2009-05-12 13:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482069, 788802, 16106, '<td valign="top">Was there no way you could have framed out that darned hot spot? This image is soooo close but is really hurt by that beam of blasting light and the resultant lack of contrast in the rest of the image.</td>', 'Was there no way you could have framed out that darned hot spot? This image is soooo close but is really hurt by that beam of blasting light and the resultant lack of contrast in the rest of the image.', '2009-05-12 13:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482153, 788984, 88136, '<td valign="top">i like this minimalistic approach. nice and simple</td>', 'i like this minimalistic approach. nice and simple', '2009-05-12 14:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482156, 790105, 88136, '<td valign="top">very well done. nice use of a longer shutter speed</td>', 'very well done. nice use of a longer shutter speed', '2009-05-12 14:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482158, 790070, 88136, '<td valign="top">gnarly clock. gnarly photo in general actually. interesting</td>', 'gnarly clock. gnarly photo in general actually. interesting', '2009-05-12 14:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482272, 789997, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and focus. Sweet little dog too!</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and focus. Sweet little dog too!', '2009-05-12 17:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482274, 788802, 327, '<td valign="top">Ewe this is a great place to shoot. Love the blue tint.</td>', 'Ewe this is a great place to shoot. Love the blue tint.', '2009-05-12 17:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482277, 789804, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely set up, great, deep reds. Nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely set up, great, deep reds. Nicely done.', '2009-05-12 17:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
