(5482281, 790003, 327, '<td valign="top">Very sculptural, and modern. I think the b&amp;w works here.</td>', 'Very sculptural, and modern. I think the b&w works here.', '2009-05-12 17:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482283, 788999, 327, '<td valign="top">Love everything about this would only of liked to see her face.</td>', 'Love everything about this would only of liked to see her face.', '2009-05-12 17:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482284, 790101, 327, '<td valign="top">Perfect for this challenge and love the title too.</td>', 'Perfect for this challenge and love the title too.', '2009-05-12 17:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482285, 789985, 327, '<td valign="top">Great colors, exciting and interesting shot. Bravo.</td>', 'Great colors, exciting and interesting shot. Bravo.', '2009-05-12 17:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482286, 790124, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture, such a face!!</td>', 'Wonderful capture, such a face!!', '2009-05-12 17:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482296, 790070, 327, '<td valign="top">San Fransiscio, California -<br/><u>House of falling furniture</u>? O'' lucky you, how perfect for this challenge!</td>', 'San Fransiscio, California -House of falling furniture? O'' lucky you, how perfect for this challenge!', '2009-05-12 17:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482416, 790127, 101256, '<td valign="top">An enjoyable image reflecting the very nature of a lazy Sunday. Very competant conversion to black and white - successful from an artistic standpoint. Perhaps a little better focus/DOF control would have helped the favorable impression sufficiently to boost it''s changes to be a top ten image. Still, a very worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'An enjoyable image reflecting the very nature of a lazy Sunday. Very competant conversion to black and white - successful from an artistic standpoint. Perhaps a little better focus/DOF control would have helped the favorable impression sufficiently to boost it''s changes to be a top ten image. Still, a very worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-12 18:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482420, 789930, 101256, '<td valign="top">Pleasing sweeping lines and curves, almost abstract in concept - a very natural and effective image. Nothing is technically wrong or remarkable and this extends to it''s artistic impression. One sometimes wants to see detail in the elements of the photo rather than smooth featureless elements, but this works for it''s elegance. Well done.</td>', 'Pleasing sweeping lines and curves, almost abstract in concept - a very natural and effective image. Nothing is technically wrong or remarkable and this extends to it''s artistic impression. One sometimes wants to see detail in the elements of the photo rather than smooth featureless elements, but this works for it''s elegance. Well done.', '2009-05-12 18:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482423, 790003, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple and efficient, very clever use of textures and blank space, rich and effective conversion to black and white, nothing technically over exposed or out of place. A sort-of abstract that is minimalist impresionism at it''s finest giving making it an artistic success. Well done.</td>', 'Simple and efficient, very clever use of textures and blank space, rich and effective conversion to black and white, nothing technically over exposed or out of place. A sort-of abstract that is minimalist impresionism at it''s finest giving making it an artistic success. Well done.', '2009-05-12 18:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482425, 789892, 101256, '<td valign="top">A technically competant image that just fails to provoke any sort of wow factor or pop. While the colors are complimentary, the subject is just uninteresting and does not invite the viewer to stay and while and look around.</td>', 'A technically competant image that just fails to provoke any sort of wow factor or pop. While the colors are complimentary, the subject is just uninteresting and does not invite the viewer to stay and while and look around.', '2009-05-12 18:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482428, 789935, 101256, '<td valign="top">The chairs and table disappear into the detailed wall - the eye has to search around to find the subject instead of being immediately attracted to it. Given it''s rather bland color obscured positioning the subject fails to attract an interest.</td>', 'The chairs and table disappear into the detailed wall - the eye has to search around to find the subject instead of being immediately attracted to it. Given it''s rather bland color obscured positioning the subject fails to attract an interest.', '2009-05-12 18:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482464, 789629, 101256, '<td valign="top">While technically competant, there is way too much flower from a perspective standpoint to be truly effective. Given the angle of the capture, the flower flowers tend to overpower the subject and while it does enhance the depth perception and gives the image a 3D feel, it''s just not that interesting.</td>', 'While technically competant, there is way too much flower from a perspective standpoint to be truly effective. Given the angle of the capture, the flower flowers tend to overpower the subject and while it does enhance the depth perception and gives the image a 3D feel, it''s just not that interesting.', '2009-05-12 19:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482479, 790093, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very post modern feel to this - abstract without being over done, dramatic use of lighting and grain and a very interesting outlining technique allowing for a very "oriental" feel to the image - very similar to the Chinese symbol for grain in fact. No technicl issues to speak of and a very favorable artistic impression. Well done.</td>', 'A very post modern feel to this - abstract without being over done, dramatic use of lighting and grain and a very interesting outlining technique allowing for a very "oriental" feel to the image - very similar to the Chinese symbol for grain in fact. No technicl issues to speak of and a very favorable artistic impression. Well done.', '2009-05-12 19:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482482, 789986, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes you gotta do what you gotta to. An unfortunate bluish cast to this rather uninteresting and flat image. It might have been better to compose this using some bokeh techniques to obscure the background which, frankly, is more intersting than the bench.</td>', 'Sometimes you gotta do what you gotta to. An unfortunate bluish cast to this rather uninteresting and flat image. It might have been better to compose this using some bokeh techniques to obscure the background which, frankly, is more intersting than the bench.', '2009-05-12 19:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482484, 790119, 101256, '<td valign="top">The unfortunate use of direct black and white causes certain features of this image to disappear into the background - there isn''t any real graduation of blacks - too much direct contrast between the whites and blacks.</td>', 'The unfortunate use of direct black and white causes certain features of this image to disappear into the background - there isn''t any real graduation of blacks - too much direct contrast between the whites and blacks.', '2009-05-12 19:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482489, 789617, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very curious sense of depth and detail - very effective treatment with the blank window space and feature less wall. An odd viewpoint which works well in context with the impression given. A little too tall, the effect of looking down into a V shape isn''t as strong as it would be if the dividing line were at exactly half of the image. Still, a very intriguing effect. The monotone treatment is also effective and while that chair highlights are a little over done, the image as a whole works very well.</td>', 'Very curious sense of depth and detail - very effective treatment with the blank window space and feature less wall. An odd viewpoint which works well in context with the impression given. A little too tall, the effect of looking down into a V shape isn''t as strong as it would be if the dividing line were at exactly half of the image. Still, a very intriguing effect. The monotone treatment is also effective and while that chair highlights are a little over done, the image as a whole works very well.', '2009-05-12 19:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482491, 789141, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very interesting angle and would have been effective except for the blank and undetailed sky which fails to provide any sense of depth and dimension. The image appears to be rather flat even given the angle and slight offset in addition to the little details in the bench.</td>', 'A very interesting angle and would have been effective except for the blank and undetailed sky which fails to provide any sense of depth and dimension. The image appears to be rather flat even given the angle and slight offset in addition to the little details in the bench.', '2009-05-12 19:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482495, 789979, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very effective portrait that would have worked as well in black and white as it did in color. Use of a comfortable chair while relaxing is certainly a good way to enter the challenge. The only issue is the rather abrupt change from total dark to shadow light, but this can be viewed in one of two ways - the postive effect is the one this reviewer prefers in this instance.</td>', 'A very effective portrait that would have worked as well in black and white as it did in color. Use of a comfortable chair while relaxing is certainly a good way to enter the challenge. The only issue is the rather abrupt change from total dark to shadow light, but this can be viewed in one of two ways - the postive effect is the one this reviewer prefers in this instance.', '2009-05-12 19:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482499, 789901, 106250, '<td valign="top">This one should win..!!</td>', 'This one should win..!!', '2009-05-12 19:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482501, 790063, 106250, '<td valign="top">Quite thoughtful</td>', 'Quite thoughtful', '2009-05-12 19:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482503, 789766, 101256, '<td valign="top">This image relies too much on the emergence from the dark to create tension and drama. A little bit of fill light to reduce the contrasty effect created by the blank window would have helped create a more favorable impression. While the author''s intent is clear, it just doesn''t feel "right".</td>', 'This image relies too much on the emergence from the dark to create tension and drama. A little bit of fill light to reduce the contrasty effect created by the blank window would have helped create a more favorable impression. While the author''s intent is clear, it just doesn''t feel "right".', '2009-05-12 19:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482507, 790105, 106250, '<td valign="top">It would have been better if the waves would have looked as crisp..as the chair.</td>', 'It would have been better if the waves would have looked as crisp..as the chair.', '2009-05-12 19:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482509, 789874, 106250, '<td valign="top">Great Composition...!!</td>', 'Great Composition...!!', '2009-05-12 19:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482511, 789507, 106250, '<td valign="top">I like this photo..</td>', 'I like this photo..', '2009-05-12 19:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482512, 789505, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very intersting drop shadow effect that works well with the rich tones and textures of the background and subject. A lot of very subtle touches in this image that create a very effective and favorable artistic impression. One has to wonder if a diffrent angle would have increased the shadow effect or ruined it - might be worth experimenting with sometime in the future.</td>', 'A very intersting drop shadow effect that works well with the rich tones and textures of the background and subject. A lot of very subtle touches in this image that create a very effective and favorable artistic impression. One has to wonder if a diffrent angle would have increased the shadow effect or ruined it - might be worth experimenting with sometime in the future.', '2009-05-12 19:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482514, 789907, 106250, '<td valign="top">Marvelous color composition. Beautiful one.</td>', 'Marvelous color composition. Beautiful one.', '2009-05-12 19:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482515, 790130, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little more experimentation with the available light would have helped the image and given it more impact. This image is right on the edge of subtle artistic perfection - the under exposure and rather dull and flat black and white treatment negatively impacts the over all positive impression.</td>', 'A little more experimentation with the available light would have helped the image and given it more impact. This image is right on the edge of subtle artistic perfection - the under exposure and rather dull and flat black and white treatment negatively impacts the over all positive impression.', '2009-05-12 19:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482518, 790128, 101256, '<td valign="top">While the image is perfectly level, the impression of it being off level and  a trapazoid is very strong. While this may, or may not, be an issue to some viewers, it certainly makes the image more interesting. A very simple construction to this composition is impressive and the sense of distance in the back ground wall is rather startling. Pleasing and complimentary colors, simple and effective subject matter, this should score fairly high.</td>', 'While the image is perfectly level, the impression of it being off level and  a trapazoid is very strong. While this may, or may not, be an issue to some viewers, it certainly makes the image more interesting. A very simple construction to this composition is impressive and the sense of distance in the back ground wall is rather startling. Pleasing and complimentary colors, simple and effective subject matter, this should score fairly high.', '2009-05-12 19:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482525, 789852, 101256, '<td valign="top">Inventive and a novel look at the challenge subject. With no technical issues to speak of, the clever use of space and subject matter rates a perfect 10 just for being different and out of the ordinary. Well done.</td>', 'Inventive and a novel look at the challenge subject. With no technical issues to speak of, the clever use of space and subject matter rates a perfect 10 just for being different and out of the ordinary. Well done.', '2009-05-12 19:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482532, 789656, 101256, '<td valign="top">Either more color or a different conversion technique is very much needed in this rather flat and unintersting image. While the author''s intent is clear, the attempt at creating a more advanced artistic impression doesn''t work.</td>', 'Either more color or a different conversion technique is very much needed in this rather flat and unintersting image. While the author''s intent is clear, the attempt at creating a more advanced artistic impression doesn''t work.', '2009-05-12 19:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482704, 790078, 88136, '<td valign="top">well done, i like it</td>', 'well done, i like it', '2009-05-12 22:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482759, 789507, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful room and contents.  I''m just not a big fan of over-processing.  Which probably means you''ll score very well :-)</td>', 'Wonderful room and contents.  I''m just not a big fan of over-processing.  Which probably means you''ll score very well :-)', '2009-05-12 22:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482763, 789810, 96751, '<td valign="top">Furniture with a story!  I like the b/w, but the lighting is too high, so it draws the eye to the wall and the shadow.</td>', 'Furniture with a story!  I like the b/w, but the lighting is too high, so it draws the eye to the wall and the shadow.', '2009-05-12 22:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482766, 790113, 96751, '<td valign="top">I so want to love this picture.  Great perspective, and the lines are very intriguing. But perhaps there is too much to look at, or the lighting could have emphasized the foreground a little more.  Maybe it''s the distant horizontal line - if that were cropped out... I don''t know.  Can''t put my finger on it.</td>', 'I so want to love this picture.  Great perspective, and the lines are very intriguing. But perhaps there is too much to look at, or the lighting could have emphasized the foreground a little more.  Maybe it''s the distant horizontal line - if that were cropped out... I don''t know.  Can''t put my finger on it.', '2009-05-12 22:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482769, 790093, 96751, '<td valign="top">The processing makes this look like an Asian letter character.</td>', 'The processing makes this look like an Asian letter character.', '2009-05-12 22:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482772, 790101, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful still life, though it has quite a bit of noise.</td>', 'Beautiful still life, though it has quite a bit of noise.', '2009-05-12 22:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482774, 790022, 96751, '<td valign="top">I want to sit here.  I think the color is overdone on the chairs though.</td>', 'I want to sit here.  I think the color is overdone on the chairs though.', '2009-05-12 22:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482777, 790022, 97814, '<td valign="top">Ha! Clever!</td>', 'Ha! Clever!', '2009-05-12 22:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482781, 790106, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely tableau.</td>', 'Lovely tableau.', '2009-05-12 22:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482785, 789617, 96751, '<td valign="top">Strong geometrical shot.  Though the chair is but a small part of the image, the framing and perspective make it a solid subject.  Great tones.</td>', 'Strong geometrical shot.  Though the chair is but a small part of the image, the framing and perspective make it a solid subject.  Great tones.', '2009-05-12 22:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482788, 788261, 96751, '<td valign="top">A classic painting quality about this shot.  Lovely tones, and warm lighting.</td>', 'A classic painting quality about this shot.  Lovely tones, and warm lighting.', '2009-05-12 22:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482790, 788802, 97814, '<td valign="top">10, ten, 10 incredible shot!</td>', '10, ten, 10 incredible shot!', '2009-05-12 22:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482794, 790070, 96751, '<td valign="top">I thought of this building when they announced the challenge.  Don''t live anywhere near it, but I''m glad somebody did.</td>', 'I thought of this building when they announced the challenge.  Don''t live anywhere near it, but I''m glad somebody did.', '2009-05-12 22:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482797, 790129, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is a very quirky family-portrait quality about this.  Would make an interesting free study shot, but isn''t much of a "furniture" shot.</td>', 'There is a very quirky family-portrait quality about this.  Would make an interesting free study shot, but isn''t much of a "furniture" shot.', '2009-05-12 22:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482798, 788882, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great sense of abandonment.</td>', 'Great sense of abandonment.', '2009-05-12 22:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482802, 789656, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern image.  I feel a bit more contrast would have added more impact.</td>', 'Nice pattern image.  I feel a bit more contrast would have added more impact.', '2009-05-12 22:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482804, 789333, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very Ikea :-)  Love the tonal contrasts, and the echo of vertical lines in the siding and table legs.  The white drawer face really gives strength to the horizontal lines.</td>', 'Very Ikea :-)  Love the tonal contrasts, and the echo of vertical lines in the siding and table legs.  The white drawer face really gives strength to the horizontal lines.', '2009-05-12 22:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482806, 790124, 97814, '<td valign="top">Sooooo cute!</td>', 'Sooooo cute!', '2009-05-12 22:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482809, 789934, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot!  The shallow dof is an interesting element, and the colors are spot on perfect.  I wish the front of the cushion would have been a bit sharper.  A definite story captured.</td>', 'What a fun shot!  The shallow dof is an interesting element, and the colors are spot on perfect.  I wish the front of the cushion would have been a bit sharper.  A definite story captured.', '2009-05-12 22:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482812, 789804, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice elements, which could have used additional lighting.</td>', 'Nice elements, which could have used additional lighting.', '2009-05-12 22:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482814, 788984, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very post-modern.  Love the vertical and horizontal lines, as well as the colors. Strong image.</td>', 'Very post-modern.  Love the vertical and horizontal lines, as well as the colors. Strong image.', '2009-05-12 22:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482817, 789911, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yeah, that''s where I''d place it, but I''d face it the other way :-)</td>', 'Yeah, that''s where I''d place it, but I''d face it the other way :-)', '2009-05-12 22:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482819, 789218, 96751, '<td valign="top">Marvelous perspective.  Great eye.</td>', 'Marvelous perspective.  Great eye.', '2009-05-12 22:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482821, 790003, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great lines and shadows.  I''d have cloned out the seam at the eds of the platform because it''s a bit messy.  But the shape of the chair and the textured background are great.</td>', 'Great lines and shadows.  I''d have cloned out the seam at the eds of the platform because it''s a bit messy.  But the shape of the chair and the textured background are great.', '2009-05-12 22:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482824, 789846, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject, which works very well in b/w.  Thank you for the title, I''d have gone nuts trying to figure it out.</td>', 'Very interesting subject, which works very well in b/w.  Thank you for the title, I''d have gone nuts trying to figure it out.', '2009-05-12 22:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482827, 789938, 96751, '<td valign="top">Sensational.  The lighting on the chair is perfect, and the pp''ing is terrific.  What an amazing sky.  And the low perspective really adds the "wow" factor.</td>', 'Sensational.  The lighting on the chair is perfect, and the pp''ing is terrific.  What an amazing sky.  And the low perspective really adds the "wow" factor.', '2009-05-12 22:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482830, 789662, 96751, '<td valign="top">That''s one tiny chaise!</td>', 'That''s one tiny chaise!', '2009-05-12 22:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482834, 789214, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely geometric shot.  Perfect in b/w.</td>', 'Lovely geometric shot.  Perfect in b/w.', '2009-05-12 22:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482836, 789687, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I''d sit on him :-)  Nice job blending him in.  Oh, and we have the exact same sofa...</td>', 'LOL!  I''d sit on him :-)  Nice job blending him in.  Oh, and we have the exact same sofa...', '2009-05-12 22:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482839, 789901, 96751, '<td valign="top">Sweet portrait, and a great job of using lighting to emphasize the girls.  But this is a furniture challenge, and in this shot it''s secondary.</td>', 'Sweet portrait, and a great job of using lighting to emphasize the girls.  But this is a furniture challenge, and in this shot it''s secondary.', '2009-05-12 22:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482840, 789920, 96751, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like a tintype!  I like the processing.  Really makes it look vintage.</td>', 'This almost looks like a tintype!  I like the processing.  Really makes it look vintage.', '2009-05-12 22:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482843, 788195, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I think the shutters overwhelm the chair though.  There is so much of them, and the chair is more on the delicate side.  Perhaps cropping out the right sidelight, or using a heftier chair might have worked.  But a lot of great detail and lines here.</td>', 'Interesting.  I think the shutters overwhelm the chair though.  There is so much of them, and the chair is more on the delicate side.  Perhaps cropping out the right sidelight, or using a heftier chair might have worked.  But a lot of great detail and lines here.', '2009-05-12 22:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482852, 789997, 96751, '<td valign="top">Excellent example of furniture as the primary element with a secondary subject.  Fabulous perspective and expression on the pooch, who''s looking straight at the camera.  Lighting is awesome, and the b/w really emphasizes the deco/nouveau window panes. Two TINY things I might have cloned out: the white spot on the collar, and the two hinges on the middle window.  But really, I''m just nitpicking here...</td>', 'Excellent example of furniture as the primary element with a secondary subject.  Fabulous perspective and expression on the pooch, who''s looking straight at the camera.  Lighting is awesome, and the b/w really emphasizes the deco/nouveau window panes. Two TINY things I might have cloned out: the white spot on the collar, and the two hinges on the middle window.  But really, I''m just nitpicking here...', '2009-05-12 22:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482854, 789562, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the tones on this.</td>', 'I love the tones on this.', '2009-05-12 22:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482857, 789936, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is so much to look at in this shot.  It took me a while to figure it out.</td>', 'There is so much to look at in this shot.  It took me a while to figure it out.', '2009-05-12 22:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482858, 789930, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice close up.  Focus is a bit soft.</td>', 'Nice close up.  Focus is a bit soft.', '2009-05-12 22:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482862, 789910, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great color combination.  I find the floor and baseboard distracting.  A tighter crop without so much white might have worked better.</td>', 'Great color combination.  I find the floor and baseboard distracting.  A tighter crop without so much white might have worked better.', '2009-05-12 22:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482864, 790120, 96751, '<td valign="top">And then they announced the Miniatures challenge.</td>', 'And then they announced the Miniatures challenge.', '2009-05-12 22:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
