(5486015, 789997, 31535, '<td valign="top">Great shot Enzo. I prefer this one to your first furniture entry. I think the angle works well to put more emphasis on the couch rather than the window. One of my top 3. 10</td>', 'Great shot Enzo. I prefer this one to your first furniture entry. I think the angle works well to put more emphasis on the couch rather than the window. One of my top 3. 10', '2009-05-14 13:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
