(5486058, 789656, 95687, '<td valign="top">I love repeating patterns and the almost illustrated nature of this photo</td>', 'I love repeating patterns and the almost illustrated nature of this photo', '2009-05-14 13:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5486060, 789997, 95687, '<td valign="top">beautiful light and processing - very nice</td>', 'beautiful light and processing - very nice', '2009-05-14 13:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5486061, 790124, 95687, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of pet/animal shots in general, but the personality leaping from this image sets it apart.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of pet/animal shots in general, but the personality leaping from this image sets it apart.', '2009-05-14 13:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5486091, 789937, 15511, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. The old and the really old. The wide angle effect to the out-of-focus area at the top is a bit uncomfortable to look at, and the result is that my eye often returns to the subject of the portrait. I''m intrigued that an image has made me "feel" that way. In that regard, you''ve accomplished more than creating an image. <br/>My mom has the complete set of china like that bowl, brought over from Germany in 1953; a memory evoked by this image.<br/>Additionally, this is the first time I''ve felt that a title is worth an extra point.</td>', 'Interesting image. The old and the really old. The wide angle effect to the out-of-focus area at the top is a bit uncomfortable to look at, and the result is that my eye often returns to the subject of the portrait. I''m intrigued that an image has made me "feel" that way. In that regard, you''ve accomplished more than creating an image. My mom has the complete set of china like that bowl, brought over from Germany in 1953; a memory evoked by this image.Additionally, this is the first time I''ve felt that a title is worth an extra point.', '2009-05-14 14:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5486096, 789804, 15511, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. The colors and lighting set the mood very effectively, but the tilt bothers me. I keep wanting to straighten the picture, and this reduces the enjoyment of the view.</td>', 'I like the composition. The colors and lighting set the mood very effectively, but the tilt bothers me. I keep wanting to straighten the picture, and this reduces the enjoyment of the view.', '2009-05-14 14:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
