(5491663, 789997, 86447, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RulerZigzag:</b></div><hr/><i>  oh and dogs can most definitely understand some words! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, they do!   <br/> <br/>You say, "Millie, come here and sit by me. What a good dog you are, Millie! Give me sexy, Millie.  That''s it, Millie!   Now... pout a bit, Millie... Yes, Millie!   Great job!"<br/> <br/>Millie hears, "<b>Millie</b> blah blah blah blah <b>Millie</b>.   Blah blah <b>Millie</b>.   Blah <b>Millie</b>!   Blah blah, <b>Millie</b>!  Blah <b>Millie</b>!  Blah!"<br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/>But, I''m so glad she sat for this.  It''s charming.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-05-18 18:44:47.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by RulerZigzag:  oh and dogs can most definitely understand some words!   Yes, they do!    You say, "Millie, come here and sit by me. What a good dog you are, Millie! Give me sexy, Millie.  That''s it, Millie!   Now... pout a bit, Millie... Yes, Millie!   Great job!" Millie hears, "Millie blah blah blah blah Millie.   Blah blah Millie.   Blah Millie!   Blah blah, Millie!  Blah Millie!  Blah!" :) But, I''m so glad she sat for this.  It''s charming.', '2009-05-18 19:44:31.000000', '2009-05-18 19:44:47.000000', 0),
