(5491802, 789985, 28322, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by timfythetoo:</b></div><hr/><i> You have come  a long way since those early Critique CLub comments you I posted. Well done Ameed. Glad to see this ribbon. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Tim, thanks allot for your kind comment, honestly saying .. wouldn''t be making it to the front without your comments and the rest of the guidance I received from the CC. <br/>Thanks allot, really appreciate it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-05-18 20:34:42.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by timfythetoo: You have come  a long way since those early Critique CLub comments you I posted. Well done Ameed. Glad to see this ribbon.   Tim, thanks allot for your kind comment, honestly saying .. wouldn''t be making it to the front without your comments and the rest of the guidance I received from the CC. Thanks allot, really appreciate it.', '2009-05-18 21:33:49.000000', '2009-05-18 21:34:42.000000', 0),
(5491864, 789997, 66384, '<td valign="top">The simplicity and light are so beautiful. And the adorable bishon doesn''t hurt either. The couch is such a nice complement to those beautiful windows. Congratulations.</td>', 'The simplicity and light are so beautiful. And the adorable bishon doesn''t hurt either. The couch is such a nice complement to those beautiful windows. Congratulations.', '2009-05-18 22:48:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5491888, 789985, 28322, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by snaffles:</b></div><hr/><i> WOW Ameed!  I am so proud of you!  Your photos have only got better and better, I should''ve placed money on you to ribbon soon. <br/> <br/>Huge congrats on what I am sure will be the first of many. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Susan, If it wasn''t up to the continues critique I receive from you, I don''t think I would''ve been able to make it to the front page. <br/>You told me before and let me quote your words ''''  A really strong entry, sadly the dramatic use of lighting didn''t resonate with most DPCiers. However, you can either shoot to please the DPC crowd, or you can (and imho) should shoot to please yourself. '''', <br/> <br/>I followed it to the letter, I was shooting to please myself, and paid extra attention to the lighting, YOU got me a ribbon, and I thank you for that :)</td>', 'Originally posted by snaffles: WOW Ameed!  I am so proud of you!  Your photos have only got better and better, I should''ve placed money on you to ribbon soon.  Huge congrats on what I am sure will be the first of many.   Susan, If it wasn''t up to the continues critique I receive from you, I don''t think I would''ve been able to make it to the front page. You told me before and let me quote your words ''''  A really strong entry, sadly the dramatic use of lighting didn''t resonate with most DPCiers. However, you can either shoot to please the DPC crowd, or you can (and imho) should shoot to please yourself. '''',  I followed it to the letter, I was shooting to please myself, and paid extra attention to the lighting, YOU got me a ribbon, and I thank you for that :)', '2009-05-18 23:19:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5491916, 789985, 28322, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by VitaminB:</b></div><hr/><i> I love it when Canadians make the ribbon column. Congrats on your first ribbon, and your PB. <br/> <br/>I bet this makes quitting smoking easier eh :)  Keep up the great work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Brad, of course :) when the winter is gone, we start kicking A$$ :)</td>', 'Originally posted by VitaminB: I love it when Canadians make the ribbon column. Congrats on your first ribbon, and your PB.  I bet this makes quitting smoking easier eh :)  Keep up the great work.   Thanks Brad, of course :) when the winter is gone, we start kicking A$$ :)', '2009-05-18 23:39:45.000000', NULL, 0),
