(5584791, 789876, 87808, '<td valign="top">well it is not bad for a chair that is floating in mid air. not something you see every day now is it. arr I thought it was basic but it wasnt, so maybe getting rid of that annoying cloud that distracts. I think a closer crop to the chair so it was a bit bigger would have helped adn a little lightening of the white underside of the chair would have given it some punch.  it is a good chair flying, but maybe having a bright red balloon on teh back of the chair would have giving it a reason to be flying in the air, cos it aint something you come across every day.</td>', 'well it is not bad for a chair that is floating in mid air. not something you see every day now is it. arr I thought it was basic but it wasnt, so maybe getting rid of that annoying cloud that distracts. I think a closer crop to the chair so it was a bit bigger would have helped adn a little lightening of the white underside of the chair would have given it some punch.  it is a good chair flying, but maybe having a bright red balloon on teh back of the chair would have giving it a reason to be flying in the air, cos it aint something you come across every day.', '2009-07-23 21:16:03.000000', NULL, 0),
