(5736720, 789507, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think this is processed just right for what it is.  And now that the challenge is over, if you wish, you can "put" something in the window.  Make it a picture, put in some curtains, add an outdoor view, whatever!  Or just leave as is - as you pointed out, it''s kinda cool the way it is.</td>', 'I think this is processed just right for what it is.  And now that the challenge is over, if you wish, you can "put" something in the window.  Make it a picture, put in some curtains, add an outdoor view, whatever!  Or just leave as is - as you pointed out, it''s kinda cool the way it is.', '2009-11-22 08:24:32.000000', NULL, 0),
