(5849207, 790113, 98339, '<td valign="top">I would have to agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=39427" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">AP</a>''s statement that possibly cropping the top of this off so that it is only chairs and tables...and possibly lowered your perspective just a little so the chairs fill the frame and it dies into the background (rather than coming from above)...that being said...I still really love this shot...it''s very, very well done</td>', 'I would have to agree with  AP''s statement that possibly cropping the top of this off so that it is only chairs and tables...and possibly lowered your perspective just a little so the chairs fill the frame and it dies into the background (rather than coming from above)...that being said...I still really love this shot...it''s very, very well done', '2010-02-02 15:54:21.000000', NULL, 0),
